WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.905
Today your child learns to find a slip alone, by reading the word back.

2
00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:06.935
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.435 --> 00:00:10.709
Each picture has a word under it. Some of the words are wrong.

4
00:00:11.159 --> 00:00:13.990
The first picture is a pot. Read the word under it.

5
00:00:16.895 --> 00:00:17.928
The word is top.

6
00:00:18.828 --> 00:00:21.132
The sounds are right, but the order is wrong.

7
00:00:21.582 --> 00:00:24.521
The next picture is a fan. Read the word under it.

8
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:28.018
This word is an.

9
00:00:28.918 --> 00:00:30.145
A sound is left out.

10
00:00:30.595 --> 00:00:33.481
The third picture is a bed. Read the word under it.

11
00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.545
The word is bad.

12
00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:39.814
The middle sound is wrong.

13
00:00:40.264 --> 00:00:45.252
Each time, your child crosses out the wrong word, and writes the right one in the boxes.

14
00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:51.308
In job two, four of the six words are wrong. Name the pictures together, then step away.

15
00:00:51.758 --> 00:00:56.708
From today, when your child writes any word, you only need three words. Read it back.
